?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Real-Time Decision Making:</strong> Quick judgments are crucial for survival.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic AI:</strong> Monsters adapt, keeping you on edge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3249630/extras/56902c39223b7ba5f5ad26fe0e1b4fdc.avif?t=1729854017\" data-has-big width=800 height=408 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Horror:</strong> Fear that challenges your sanity with subtle cues and unexpected moments.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>You Can Play It On A CRT:</strong>\u00a0Its Aspect ratio is 4:3/1.33\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In &quot;The Last Customer,&quot; trust no one and fear everyone. Can you survive the night and uncover the truth? Step into Mike\u2019s shoes and prepare for relentless suspense and terror.</p>",
